#!/usr/bin/env bun
// Stable entrypoint for the fleex CLI.
//
// Historically a 1900-line bash script. Now a 2-line TS shim that imports the
// actual implementation living in packages/cli. This file's PATH is the only
// thing the install/upgrade contract depends on:
//   ~/.fleex/bin/fleex -> <repo>/cli/fleex
// Keeping this file at this path means upgrades from any prior install just
// work: the symlink target never moves, only the content of this file does.
import '../packages/cli/index.ts';
